      "touchstones": "<h3>Convictions</h3><ul><li>Never ignore a pattern</li><li>Knowledge without action is complicity</li></ul><h3>Touchstones</h3><ul><li><strong>Mateo Ruiz-Okoye</strong>: An epidemiology PhD candidate whose dissertation she advises by email without him knowing who she is.</li></ul>",
