    "biography": "<p>@UUID[JournalEntry.yaAsxCkCLf8CANL5]{Profile: Dr. Anneliese Voight}</p><blockquote><p><em>“An epidemic never starts with the first death. It starts with the first data point nobody wanted to look at.”</em></p></blockquote><table class=\"sbn-ficha\"><tbody><tr><th>Epithet</th><td>She Who Watches the Net</td></tr><tr><th>Concept</th><td>Regent of the Observatory Chantry and Tremere Primogen</td></tr><tr><th>Clan</th><td>Tremere</td></tr><tr><th>Sect</th><td>Camarilla</td></tr><tr><th>Sire</th><td>Regent Friedrich Ahlers of Vienna (destroyed in 1945)</td></tr><tr><th>Born</th><td>1891</td></tr><tr><th>Embraced</th><td>1924</td></tr><tr><th>Ambition</th><td>For the Seattle Camarilla to survive the age of data.</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Demeanor</h3><p>Looks about thirty-three. Petite, very short hair in its natural color, rimless glasses, a black turtleneck, and a lab coat; Viennese accent.</p>",
